{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "047shu_402_2_4_047_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7502c304a3a96f72076363f752243017a0223f2b5fe196b6ff877d0456eb07b8",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:047shu_402_2_4_047_02_09_a:2_4_047_02_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1df17aa629606d4dfdf905d1de0d9ef2a8cfe406e54868a9fc626dc7c9a23c6b",
      "text": "辛苦了，●●●●プロデューサー。\n那个……下次要不要跟我一起打游戏？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_402_2_4_047_02_09_a:2_4_047_02_09_a:cmd-000008:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abdb5db6aa7a07c6b8852960fa403de134b57d5b55eb4344468e053ae0d3702b",
      "text": "是指那款游戏吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_402_2_4_047_02_09_a:2_4_047_02_09_a:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:756e998ad6631923837104face28899b677247a3dab9b134527a602391860385",
      "text": "没错，就是我们负责演唱主题曲的那款。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_402_2_4_047_02_09_a:2_4_047_02_09_a:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b86949bdaa60087c830ca2584d3caf3f4468cf441280f762bbbffbee75293a2c",
      "text": "最近更新了版本，\n追加了一个挺特殊的对战模式。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_402_2_4_047_02_09_a:2_4_047_02_09_a:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83827414d13376ebcc235677cdde002fcabf277170940867aa410a928fb6a587",
      "text": "我觉得要是能和你一起玩应该挺不错的。如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_402_2_4_047_02_09_a:2_4_047_02_09_a:cmd-000017:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2ca7730eb1a05ccc573722b5c4e0cf0c7fb042ac616a0b66b4d5f0d5c2f299a",
      "text": "感觉完全赢不了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_402_2_4_047_02_09_a:2_4_047_02_09_a:cmd-000018:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdf41a8cb2e3b75d64fc717e2873614d959b9fd4d6c9b02f2b56221d07513032",
      "text": "我可不会输哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_402_2_4_047_02_09_a:2_4_047_02_09_a:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:addfb07e695b932a64799550f7ac3f846a8f64d70eab8193fea295aa7aa88c92",
      "text": "放心，宣传上都说了新手也能玩得很开心。\n嘛，我可以让你一点。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_402_2_4_047_02_09_a:2_4_047_02_09_a:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcebbb667219b228be1feb57b39a56f8cc850f2999137c03e14ea6835e90284a",
      "text": "挺有底气的嘛。\n那我也要动真格的了，你可做好心理准备吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_402_2_4_047_02_09_a:2_4_047_02_09_a:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8df6fd65e7ebbcdb464833a9bfe62923d67032885766846d1be1f5d1115dcebb",
      "text": "对了。要是你输了的话，\n能答应我一个条件吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_402_2_4_047_02_09_a:2_4_047_02_09_a:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:037db9307b65d1d338c476a9ba69a8fd989a2e40d87ef04c0e0d99b6db15e878",
      "text": "相对的要是我输了，也可以答应你任何一个要求。\n嘛，虽然我觉得绝无可能就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_402_2_4_047_02_09_a:2_4_047_02_09_a:cmd-000033:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5cc19c482dc19f9d5dffe7e5d368fd678cde9548bac692e35d9f5eb5a663d25",
      "text": "得好好想想该提什么要求了。\n那就这样，我很期待哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
